            </p>
            <a class="mt-6 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#1967D2] px-5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-[#1558B0] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-[#1967D2]">
                Ask about getting started <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
